      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "improve: reduce repeated session startup scans",
        "body": "Related: #99190\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where long-lived session transcripts could still be touched with full-file scans on run startup paths even when only the first JSONL header line was needed, and where large AGENTS.md bootstrap content could be re-scanned for the same policy digest every turn.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis keeps the no-assistant session reset guard bounded to the first non-empty transcript header line instead of reading the full JSONL file, while preserving the existing fail-closed behavior for corrupt headers, including blank-prefixed transcripts. It also caches AGENTS.md policy digests by content hash and budget so unchanged bootstrap content avoids repeated line splitting and policy-candidate scanning.\n\nThis intentionally does not replace SessionManager cold-open parsing with a tail-only reader yet; that path also restores model/thinking state, retained compaction tails, leaf controls, labels, and mutation-safe transcript state, so it needs a separate indexed or equivalence-proven design.\n\nAI-assisted: yes.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers with long-running agent sessions should see less avoidable pre-LLM file work in startup/bootstrap paths. Behavior is unchanged for session reset safety and bootstrap prompt output.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/session-manager-init.test.ts\n  - 8 passed, including blank-prefixed corrupt-header and capped blank-prefix preservation coverage.\n- node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/embedded-agent-helpers.buildbootstrapcontextfiles.test.ts\n  - 24 passed.\n- git diff --check\n- Local long-session startup proof with a generated 57,300,171-byte transcript through `prepareSessionManagerForRun`:\n  - `{\"scenario\":\"long-session-reset\",\"beforeSize\":57300171,\"afterSize\":0,\"elapsedMs\":1.22}`\n  - `{\"scenario\":\"capped-blank-prefix-corrupt-header\",\"rejected\":true,\"preserved\":true,\"elapsedMs\":12.07}`\n",
        "branch": "feature/issue-99190-transcript-tail-read",
